Subject: Let the compiler line choose STBTT_DEF

stb_image and stb_image_write let the includer choose the linkage of their
API (#ifndef STBIDEF, #ifndef STBIWDEF); stb_truetype does not, so
plutovg-font.c's STBTT_STATIC makes every stbtt_* function static, and the
thirty that plutovg never calls each draw -Wunused-function under -Wall,
which R CMD check reports as a significant warning.

Guard STBTT_DEF the same way, so a build can define it (zusvg passes
-DSTBTT_DEF=extern, with the symbols hidden by -fvisibility=hidden).
Unchanged when STBTT_DEF is not defined.

zusvg: .agents/design.md §14. Offered upstream.

--- a/plutovg/source/plutovg-stb-truetype.h
+++ b/plutovg/source/plutovg-stb-truetype.h
@@ -499,11 +499,13 @@
 #ifndef PLUTOVG_STB_TRUETYPE_H
 #define PLUTOVG_STB_TRUETYPE_H
 
+#ifndef STBTT_DEF
 #ifdef STBTT_STATIC
 #define STBTT_DEF static
 #else
 #define STBTT_DEF extern
 #endif
+#endif
 
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 extern "C" {
